okoPremium2026\nLihat Lebih Sedikit', 'https://www.tokopedia.com/fadkhera-official/fadkhera-khalil-baju-koko-pria-modern-premium-atasan-muslim-lengan-panjang-1734181951131649921', 'data:image/svg+xml,%3csvg xmlns=%27http://www.w3.org/2000/svg%27 version=%271.1%27 width=%27100%27 h', '2026-09-28 07:39:52'),
